From: Etaash Mathamsetty
 <45927311+Etaash-mathamsetty@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 03:08:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 228/268] atiadlxx: Mark that adapters exist and are present.

---
 dlls/atiadlxx/atiadlxx_main.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/atiadlxx/atiadlxx_main.c b/dlls/atiadlxx/atiadlxx_main.c
index 5d3f1cc5709..6c5ffa65c0c 100644
--- a/dlls/atiadlxx/atiadlxx_main.c
+++ b/dlls/atiadlxx/atiadlxx_main.c
@@ -760,6 +760,8 @@ static int adapter_info_get(ADL_CONTEXT_HANDLE ctx, ADLAdapterInfo *adapters, in
         adapters[i].iBusNumber = 0;
         adapters[i].iFunctionNumber = 0;
         adapters[i].iDeviceNumber = 0;
+        adapters[i].iExist = 1;
+        adapters[i].iPresent = 1;
 
         strcpy(buffer, ctx->adapters[i].gpu->device_path + 4);
         if ((p = strrchr(buffer, '#'))) *p = 0;
